    "body": "Review blocker fixed (head 8abd4c84, after a clean merge of upstream/main, no conflicts):\n\n- `crates/post/tests/recorded/mod.rs`: the `(\"doosan-dnm.cps\", \"probe\", 995)` entry and its comment are gone from `KNOWN_BUGS` (now empty; the mechanism and `a_known_post_bug_has_no_golden` stay for the next bug).\n- Recorded `crates/post/tests/recorded/golden/doosan-dnm/probe.nc` with `WRITE_GOLDEN=1 cargo test -p camcraft-post --test script_doosan_dnm -- probe --exact`; no other golden changed. Read before committing: no M7/M8/M9 anywhere in it. The probe section opens:\n\n```\n(T07 PROBE-4 - D4)\nT07 M6\nG43 H07\nM5\nG00 X30 Y30 Z50\nG31 X30 Y30 Z25 F300\nIF[ABS[#5063-25]GT0.001]THEN#3000=3(PROBE HIT ON POSITIONING)\n...\nG10 L2 P2 X[#5221+#190] Y[#5222+#191]\nM5\nG91 G28 Z0\n```\n\nTests (without WRITE_GOLDEN): `recorded_streams` 12/12, `script_doosan_dnm` 11/11, app `probe_no_coolant` 5/5; `cargo clippy -p camcraft-post --all-targets -- -D warnings` clean.\n",
