    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: 8abd4c84f876356f8ba5643c1b03bf0b86c6300e -->\n**Delta review (M3): ready for the maintainer to merge.** Both items from M5's review are fixed.\n\n**The review's items:**\n- `KNOWN_BUGS` in `crates/post/tests/recorded/mod.rs` is empty: the doosan-dnm probe entry for #995 is gone.\n- `golden/doosan-dnm/probe.nc` is recorded and has no M7/M8/M9 anywhere. The probe section stops the spindle (`M5`) and writes no coolant word. This is the only golden that changed.\n\n**The merge commit:** 5b88a676 is a merge of main with an empty remerge-diff.\n\n**Local results,** trial-merged with current main (clean):\n- `recorded_streams` 12, `script_doosan_dnm` 11.\n\nThe `needs-rework` label was ours (mkinney), so I removed it, now that the items are fixed.\n",
